{"author":{"id":"7c5527b9befade3b1be0c1d677ac996815288d8332f34269730a5b81425ee5be"},"ops":[{"type":5,"timestamp":1791208922,"nonce":"iU5lJpX8Qaa/n15OCu6y4dHRiB4=","metadata":{"sync:github.com/epfl-enac/vps-mitsi:id":"LE_lADOULtcMc8AAAABVItq2s8AAAAHkglHBg","sync:github.com/epfl-enac/vps-mitsi:labels":"refactor"},"added":["refactor"],"removed":[]},{"type":6,"timestamp":1791272567,"nonce":"++TKIWwuLuyc8GbglrC2qo1XjX0=","metadata":{"sync:github.com/epfl-enac/vps-mitsi:id":"UCE_lAHOULtcMc8AAAABVItq2s7-YKO1","sync:github.com/epfl-enac/vps-mitsi:text":"f9cdda5c99b265cbff05975ff0574cb674688f6e71e845c7fe86eefb36c2cc24"},"target":"6b811729a24a6709a8d13d10c58e96249db8e7b34959ab43b07d857f2f1ce947","message":"**TL;DR**\n- **What:** simplify what we save.\n- **Why:** unused v2 data, and duplicated totals that can drift out of sync.\n- **User impact:** none, and memory/storage totals show in GB instead of \"64.00\".\n- **Blocked by:** #43.\n\n---\n\n**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**\nThe saved assessment format (`MitsiStateSchema` in `frontend/src/models/schema.ts`, `MITSI_SCHEMA_VERSION = 4`) stores data it shouldn't.\n\n1. **Underlying services, a feature excluded from v1, is wired throughout.** The lead decision recorded in `ResultsPage.vue` keeps it out of v1, yet:\n   - the schema defines `UnderlyingServiceSchema` and its draft variant, and `includeUnderlyingServices` and `underlyingServices` are saved in every draft and export;\n   - the store holds both refs and `totalUnderlying`, adds it into `totalLifespan`, and handles it in `reset`, `buildState` and `applyState`;\n   - `TotalSplitPieChart.vue` takes an `underlying` prop and falls back to the hard-coded label `'Underlying services'`;\n   - `ResultsPage.vue` carries v2 comment blocks describing how to switch it on.\n2. **`memoryTotalGb` and `storageTotal` are saved but always recalculated.** `schema.ts` marks both as \"computed in store (quantity × size); not authoritative in exported JSON\". The inventory table always recalculates them, so a saved value can disagree with quantity × size.\n3. **Those two totals are also displayed with the wrong formatter.** `HardwareInventoryTable.vue` renders them with `formatKg`, so 64 GB shows as `64.00`.\n\n**Describe the solution you'd like**\n**Prerequisite (blocking):** removing fields means bumping `MITSI_SCHEMA_VERSION` to 5. Today `parseState` (`stores/mitsi.ts`) rejects any other version:\n- a v4 draft in localStorage silently loads as empty, and the next Save overwrites it;\n- v4 export files are rejected with a generic \"import failed\".\n\nSo a migration path has to exist first. Following \"refactor first, then change behaviour\":\n- [ ] Refactor, no behaviour change: move parsing, serializing and version handling out of the store into a small, pure, tested module.\n- [ ] Behaviour: add a v4 → v5 migration (drop the fields below) and a visible error for unknown versions, both for localStorage drafts and for imported files. Tracked in #43.\n\nThen:\n- [ ] Delete the underlying-services schema, draft schema and type; the store refs, `totalUnderlying` and their place in `totalLifespan`, `reset`, `buildState` and `applyState`; the chart's `underlying` prop and its hard-coded label; and the v2 comments in `ResultsPage.vue`. Bring it back when v2 is specified.\n- [ ] Remove `memoryTotalGb` and `storageTotal` from `HardwareItemSchema`. Keep them as display-only derived columns.\n- [ ] Format the derived memory and storage totals as GB, not with `formatKg`, and add a regression test.\n- [ ] Update `store.test.mjs` and `schema.test.mjs` with a v4 fixture that migrates to v5.\n\n**Describe alternatives you've considered**\nKeep the fields \"for v2\". That keeps every v1 user's data carrying unused state, keeps a total that can silently include a hidden contribution, and means the v2 design is already fixed before anyone has specified it.\n\n**Additional context**\nRaised in an architecture review of `dev` at `b35fc8c` (section 5). The migration prerequisite is tracked in #43.","files":null},{"type":2,"timestamp":1791272567,"nonce":"67jDq5RdXZor4dv/zjBu135zO00=","metadata":{"sync:github.com/epfl-enac/vps-mitsi:id":"RTE_lADOULtcMc8AAAABVItq2s8AAAAHlcnaHQ","sync:github.com/epfl-enac/vps-mitsi:title":"[TASK](Data model) Remove unused and duplicated data from saved assessments"},"title":"[TASK](Data model) Remove unused and duplicated data from saved assessments","was":"[REFACTOR](Data model) Remove underlying services and derived totals from the saved format (needs schema migration)"}]}